Posting dates stay separate from posting comments in the CLI and API.

========== CLI ==========

ledlight postings --format json

========== API ==========

postings()

========== FILE ==========

commodity SEK
  default
  format 1,000.00 SEK
account Assets:Cash
account Equity:Opening

2024-01-01 Dated postings
  Assets:Cash  10 SEK ; [2024-01-02] card
  Equity:Opening  -10 SEK ; [2024-01-03]

========== OUTPUT ==========

[
  {
    "postingId": 1,
    "transactionId": 4,
    "transactionDate": "2024-01-01",
    "filename": "{{JOURNAL_PATH}}",
    "transactionSourceLine": 7,
    "description": "Dated postings",
